    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A band of bold pirates and their legendary captain are tantalizingly close to obtaining wealth beyond their wildest dreams! But the search for treasure is a daunting task. Captain Inigo Martinez and his pirate crew could use some help. Facing danger on the high seas, exploring remote and mysterious far reaches of the oceans \u2014 all of that and much more is in store for our seasoned seafarers on a journey to find a fabulous treasure! Remember: a pirate never backs down! Not from a storm, not from a horrifying monster, not from a bloody battle at sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 200 different Solitaire games with a difficulty setting of your choice. Join the pirate crew and journey to discover the legendary treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Follow along with the story of pirates hunting for a fabulous treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique take on Solitaire with an intriguing plot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging and straightforward gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build up the best combo you can to earn bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In-game helpers and bonuses to help you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Search for the legendary treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 200 unique and fantastic games of Solitaire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge yourself to overcome various obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
